c stack. It tells us in particular that the residual\ngerbe of <MATH_0001> at <MATH_0002> exists whenever <MATH_0003> is a finite type point!", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c8621e0f92862de331129650c479499ea6240751d83ed89c5fa3e0846c239875", "unit_id": "inventory:stacks-morphisms:06FW:paragraph/0003"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:8b26b3d8a49d9960af9933351439032eb84b4f2ac69c6ae0534b009fe0b577ee", "hash": "sha256:8b26b3d8a49d9960af9933351439032eb84b4f2ac69c6ae0534b009fe0b577ee", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 135227, "byte_start": 131266, "file": "stacks-morphisms.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:b6d35b9f047cd5d7cd532f8ca12b84ca15a89a8d90ab2680976796d9112423bc", "line_end": 3697, "line_start": 3605}, "owner_tag": "06G3", "parent_tag": "06FW", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06FW", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$x$", "MATH_0002": "$U$", "MATH_0003": "$u \\in U$", "MATH_0004": "$\\varphi : U \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\varphi(u) = x$", "MATH_0006": "$u = \\Spec(\\kappa(u))$", "MATH_0007": "$R = u \\times_\\mathcal{X} u$", "MATH_0008": "$(u, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0009": "$R \\to u$", "MATH_0010": "$$\nR = u \\times_\\mathcal{X} u \\to\nu \\times_\\mathcal{X} U \\to\nu \\times_\\mathcal{X} X = u\n$$", "MATH_0011": "$u \\to U$", "MATH_0012": "$U \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0013": "$s, t : R \\to u$", "MATH_0014": "$u$", "MATH_0015": "$s, t$", "MATH_0016": "$\\mathcal{Z} = [u/R]$", "MATH_0017": "$$\nf : \\mathcal{Z} \\longrightarrow \\mathcal{X}\n$$", "MATH_0018": "$\\mathcal{Z}_x \\subset \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0019": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0020": "$x$", "MATH_0021": "$f$", "MATH_0022": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{Z}_x$", "MATH_0023": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nu \\ar[d] \\ar[r] & U \\ar[d] \\\\\n\\mathcal{Z} \\ar[r]^f & \\mathcal{X}\n}\n$$", "MATH_0024": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nu \\times_\\mathcal{X} U \\ar[d] \\ar[r] &\n\\mathcal{Z} 